    </laneSet>
    <textAnnotation id="note_every-unserved-excess_lane">
      <text>An empty lane is a layer nothing draws on, not an idle one: every layer carries figures, and BPMN has no glyph to show them. [assets/sqlc/diagrams/lane_grain.sqlc]</text>
    </textAnnotation>
    <textAnnotation id="note_every-unserved-excess_scope">
      <text>Scope: scoped. The pool is the whole system only when the filing says `complete`. [assets/sqlc/diagrams/scopes.sqlc]</text>
    </textAnnotation>
    <textAnnotation id="note_every-unserved-excess_search">
